The public function capture_runs(frames, selected) models recording selected frames without any device or network access. frames and selected must be non-string sequences of equal length; otherwise raise ValueError. Every selected element must be exactly bool. Return a tuple containing one tuple per maximal consecutive run whose selected value is True, preserving order. Deep-copy each captured frame so neither later input mutation nor mutation through one mutable frame can affect the returned data. Empty input and input with no selected frames return an empty tuple.

